### SIS 1 - Task API HTTP collection
### Start the app (dev profile), then run the requests from top to bottom.
### Tasks are stored in memory: after a restart the first created task has id = 1 again.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@id = 1


### ===================== SUCCESS =====================

### 1. POST valid -> 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Spring Boot",
  "description": "Finish SIS 1",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

### 2. GET all -> 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks

### 3. GET existing -> 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{id}}

### 4. PUT valid -> 200 OK
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Spring Boot (updated)",
  "description": "SIS 1 is almost done",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "completed": true
}


### ===================== ERRORS =====================

### 5. POST invalid (blank title, no priority) -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "No title and no priority"
}

### 6. POST malformed JSON -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Broken json",

### 7. PUT invalid -> 400 Bad Request
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "priority": "",
  "completed": false
}

### 8. GET missing -> 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/999

### 9. GET invalid id (not a number) -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/abc

### 10. PUT missing -> 404 Not Found
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Does not exist",
  "description": "test",
  "priority": "LOW",
  "completed": false
}

### 11. DELETE missing -> 404 Not Found
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/999add


### ===================== DELETE =====================

### 12. DELETE existing -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{id}}

### 13. GET deleted task -> 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{id}}